{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"pwd; wc -l AGENTS.md docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md docs/CURRENT_STATE.md docs/DECISIONS.md; rg -n 'D74[5-9]|\"'^## §?0|''^## 0'\"' docs/DECISIONS-log.md docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md | tail -35\"","aggregated_output":"/Users/lchingen/hivemind\n     492 AGENTS.md\n     201 docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md\n    1114 docs/CURRENT_STATE.md\n    1094 docs/DECISIONS.md\n    2901 total\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:12:## 0. Checklist before every start (Alex: \"每次开始前都需要revisit\")\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11484:## D745 · 2026-11-23 · The D744 re-read calibrates the readers but stops on a qualifier-list gap and on S's unsupported share; council 59 recommends a targeted $0 test of one clarification, for Alex to authorize\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11516:- **Council round 60** (`codex-r60.md`) set the wording and the registration (`SMALL-DESIGN.md` §5 [D745]):\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11524:## D746 · 2026-11-23 · The D745 targeted test fails on E's unsized cut; S splits on how far an indirect comparison can support a forecast; council 61–61b: one general question to Alex, then a $0 stored-answer re-read; the paid re-send stays on hold\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11549:    2. **Writers size a risk without evidence.** 3 of 4 E replies across two runs carry a disputed cut or share, and D745's sentence\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11565:      open in practice. A clean re-read does not turn D745 into a pass.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11573:## D747 · 2026-11-23 · Alex rules that a forecast may rest on an explained indirect comparison\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11575:- **The question** (after D746): \"资料没直接给出题目问的那个数，只能拿一个相关的数字来比。比如问四大云厂商今年的数据中心开支能不能过 7000 亿，资料只说“这四家 AI 基础设施开支超过 7300 亿”。这种比较能说明结果更可能落在线的某一边，但另一边也还有可能。这时系统可以发布预测吗，还是要等资料能直接算出落在哪边？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11588:  - D745's ruling still holds: a justified unresolved answer counts as usable.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11589:- **Next (D746).** The ruling's words go into the shared reader definitions (`blind_rules.py`). Then one $0 blinded re-read of nine\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11592:## D748 · 2026-11-23 · The D747 re-read fails on a self-contradicting floor; three of four earlier splits settle under the ruling; council 63: ask Alex to authorize the E writer repair; the paid re-send stays on hold\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11618:      On U02, one side accepted the band and the other required the writer's stated route. D747 already rejects U02's route. No\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11624:  - **The recommendation.** Ask Alex to authorize the E writer repair despite the three disclosed splits. D746 made the repair\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11641:## D749 · 2026-11-23 · Alex authorizes the E writer repair and its $0 writer test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11643:- **The question** (after D748): \"下一步怎么走？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11653:  blind writer test on E, S and P-v8, with the saved U05 (invented cut) and U02 (impossible floor) as reader controls, under D748's\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
